5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure the new system actually works in the yards. I'll check the yard devices and the depot calendar.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm concerned about the long-term costs. I'll look into the renewal invoices and the board minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know why our projects fail. I'll investigate support ownership during the outage and the warehouse rule changes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm worried about things getting old or broken! I'll check the dispatch tool's upgrade history and the 2018 data lift.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,The human element is what matters most. I shall look into administrator retirements and the depot supervisors' experience with the last rollout.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
